{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47018","headline":"石竹花 · 齐己","name":"石竹花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石竹花开照庭石，红藓自禀离宫色。\n一枝两枝初笑风，猩猩血泼低低丛。\n常嗟世眼无真鉴，却被丹青苦相陷。\n谁爲根寻造化功，爲君吐出淳元胆。\n白日当午方盛开，彤霞灼灼临池台。\n繁香浓艳如未已，粉蝶游蜂狂欲死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}